core-forced-by-paper : Node
core-forced-by-paper = node "Every part of the core C (src/net.c, lang.c, syntax.c, store.c, dnf.c, big.c) classified by the paper's section that forces it or by nothing, with the measured cost of what nothing forces and what removing it changes; then the removals, each with its proof and byte-identical outputs." (cons language-implementation-remainder nil)
